# PSR-4b-host-imports — careful shrink (11 → 8)

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Route operator photo key via wizardMedia binding | Yes |
| Remove Denali frozen-error instanceof from settings catalog | Yes |
| Neutralize UrbanTourPatchBody type on tour-write dispatch | Yes |
| Rewrite smoke seeds / finance ledger / migrate constants | **No** |
| Delete Denali exports | **No** |

## Changes

| File | Before | After |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `tours/tour-wizard-photos.routes.ts` | direct `isDenaliOperatorTourPhotoReadKeyAllowed` | `media.isOperatorReadKeyAllowed` from generated binding |
| `settings/wizard-template-catalog.ts` | `instanceof DenaliWizardTemplateFrozenFieldMissingError` | match stable `code` + `canonicalPath` |
| `tours/workspace-tour-write-dispatch.ts` | `UrbanTourPatchBody` type import | `unknown` gate body |

### Manifest / codegen

- `wizardMedia.isOperatorReadKeyAllowedExport` (optional) on Denali manifest
- `WORKSPACE-MANIFEST.schema.json` documents the optional property
- `generateWizardMediaBindings` emits `isOperatorReadKeyAllowed` when set

## Metrics

| Metric | Before | After |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| Host-source branded files | 11 | **8** |
| Product defaults | 0 | 0 |

Remaining host-source (deferred): `app.ts`, migrate-canonical constants, urban exposure,
3 smoke seeds, equipment-icon settings contract, finance ledger exclusive.

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Host-source ceiling ≤8 | required |
| Photo GET still uses operator key semantics | required |
| No product-default regression | required |
| Tour-write dispatch specs green | required |
